      <PointerOffset>47148</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_149_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やーっぱ、&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;はすんげぇなぁ～</JapaneseText>
