      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47368</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_149_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でもまーあれだよな。今回はオレ出てなかったしさ～
いや、でも優勝は優勝だよ？　でもオレがなぁ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, y'know... My skills are the best, right? I mean, a
victory's a victory... But if they don't get to fight me...</EnglishText>
